{
    "title": "Happy Escape Tycoon",
    "description": "You are the boss of an Escape Room center! Hire staff, unlock new features, and create the most thrilling themed escape rooms! Step by step, become the business tycoon of the Escape Room world!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf6c\ud83c\udfaa Manage your Escape Room center with your team! This is a relaxing yet exciting escape room management game with bizarre stories and a variety of fun game elements waiting for you to explore!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd79Gameplay:\r\n\ud83c\udfae Idle management: Build your escape empire hands-free.\r\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Tower defense mini-games: Add fun to business management by mixing strategy and play.\r\n\ud83d\udd13 Items Unlocking: Discover and obtain a variety of game props and facilities.\r\n\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Room Decoration: Set up thrilling themes and see who gets scared!\r\n\ud83c\udfad Staff recruitment: Build your dream team and achieve your ultimate management dream!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Game Features:\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Cartoon style: Cute art design for a relaxing and enjoyable visual experience.\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Folklore tales: Rich cultural elements integrated for more fun.\r\n\ud83c\udfa2 Smooth experience: Fluid game mechanics make managing more enjoyable.\r\n\u2692\ufe0f Diverse gameplay: Combine management and tower defense strategy for varied fun.\r\n\r\nLet's start an Escape Room center together! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udfad See who's the scaredy-cat and who's the real business tycoon! Can't resist this casual experience with a new gaming mode at all!  Are you ready for the challenge? Download Happy Escape Tycoon now and begin your thrilling Escape Room management adventure \ud83d\ude80!",
    "descriptionHTML": "You are the boss of an Escape Room center! Hire staff, unlock new features, and create the most thrilling themed escape rooms! Step by step, become the business tycoon of the Escape Room world!<br><br>\ud83c\udf6c\ud83c\udfaa Manage your Escape Room center with your team! This is a relaxing yet exciting escape room management game with bizarre stories and a variety of fun game elements waiting for you to explore!<br><br>\ud83d\udd79Gameplay:<br>\ud83c\udfae Idle management: Build your escape empire hands-free.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Tower defense mini-games: Add fun to business management by mixing strategy and play.<br>\ud83d\udd13 Items Unlocking: Discover and obtain a variety of game props and facilities.<br>\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Room Decoration: Set up thrilling themes and see who gets scared!<br>\ud83c\udfad Staff recruitment: Build your dream team and achieve your ultimate management dream!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Game Features:<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Cartoon style: Cute art design for a relaxing and enjoyable visual experience.<br>\ud83d\udcd6 Folklore tales: Rich cultural elements integrated for more fun.<br>\ud83c\udfa2 Smooth experience: Fluid game mechanics make managing more enjoyable.<br>\u2692\ufe0f Diverse gameplay: Combine management and tower defense strategy for varied fun.<br><br>Let&#39;s start an Escape Room center together! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udfad See who&#39;s the scaredy-cat and who&#39;s the real business tycoon! Can&#39;t resist this casual experience with a new gaming mode at all!  Are you ready for the challenge? Download Happy Escape Tycoon now and begin your thrilling Escape Room management adventure \ud83d\ude80!",
